# Windows
ENBW(x)
Equivalent noise bandwidth of window x

generate_Hanning_window(N)
Generate a Hanning window of N samples in length.
Where window is sin2(pi*x/N)

Telecoms.Hanning_window(x)
Apply Hanning window to x

# Phase analysis
Telecoms.analytic(x)
Hilbert transform of AC signal.

unwrap(phi)

Telecoms.unwrap_analytic(x)
Compute phase evolution of complex-valued signal.

Telecoms.instantaneous_frequency(t, x)
Compute instantaneous frequency of the signal with discrete
derivative according to sample period of t. In Hz.
Consider removing random final sample.

Telecoms.frequency_spectrum(t, x; f_0)
Compute frequency spectrum in Hz^2/Hz of x where f_0 is the carrier 
frequency.

Telecoms.frequency_spectrum_favg(filenames, data_fn; f_0)
Compute the frequency spectrum of all OMA-binary-words-encoded data in 
array of data filenames filenames and store the result as waveform 
packed floats in data_fn.
(Filename array may be obtained using Julia function readdir)

# Filtering
Telecoms.block_DC_fft(x)
Shift signal to 0 using FFT method.

Telecoms.block_DC_mean
Shift signal to 0 by subtracting statistical mean from it.
